[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2458857495","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98885#issuecomment-2458857495","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98885","id":2458857495,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SjzAX","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-06T07:03:17Z","updated_at":"2024-11-06T07:03:17Z","body":"If I recall correctly, the allowed syntax within a shader include file comes from the type of file in which it is included. Have you tried including the shaderinclude file from a canvas item shader?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2458857495/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2459093940","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98885#issuecomment-2459093940","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98885","id":2459093940,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Sksu0","user":{"login":"tetrapod00","id":145553014,"node_id":"U_kgDOCKz2dg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145553014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00","html_url":"https://github.com/tetrapod00","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-06T09:19:54Z","updated_at":"2024-11-06T09:19:54Z","body":"Yeah, it seems like the actual shader will compile fine, but the shader include will show a compile error if it is open.\r\n\r\n`test_inc.gdshaderinc`\r\n```\r\nvarying vec2 v;\r\nvoid vertex()\r\n{\r\n\tv = VERTEX; // VERTEX should be a vec2 in a CanvasItem shader.\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n`canvas_test.gdshader`:\r\n```\r\nshader_type canvas_item;\r\n\r\n#include \"res://test_inc.gdshaderinc\"\r\n// Includes this:\r\n//varying vec2 v;\r\n//void vertex()\r\n//{\r\n\t//v = VERTEX; // VERTEX should be a vec2 in a CanvasItem shader.\r\n//}\r\n\r\nvoid fragment() {\r\n\tCOLOR = vec4(v, 0.0, 1.0);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe sprite shows up fine, and the canvas item shader compiles fine with no errors.\r\n![Godot_v4 3-stable_win64_fWisSCpdHL](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f2870875-1250-42c1-9e88-38a5c2be1244)\r\nHowever, the shader include file has a compile error when the file is open.\r\n![Godot_v4 3-stable_win64_B5CGt5LL2a](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5981770c-60b1-4fda-8fa7-22f54562bee3)\r\n\r\n\r\nThere is probably *some* documentation improvement that could be made in the [#include](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_preprocessor.html#include) section.\r\n\r\nThere are probably also some improvements that could be made to the either the preprocessor or the way shader include files are compiled and displayed in the shader editor. \r\n\r\nBut it seems like the basic functionality here is fine, it just has some compile errors (in the editor) that can be safely ignored.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2459093940/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2459422744","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98885#issuecomment-2459422744","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98885","id":2459422744,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Sl9AY","user":{"login":"MGilleronFJ","id":105369548,"node_id":"U_kgDOBkfPzA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105369548?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MGilleronFJ","html_url":"https://github.com/MGilleronFJ","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MGilleronFJ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MGilleronFJ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MGilleronFJ/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MGilleronFJ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MGilleronFJ/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MGilleronFJ/orgs","repos_url":"htt